{
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "External ground truth for the II benchmark suite. Every entry names a stable, publicly verifiable fact, the answer substring that must appear, and the source domains that are allowed to support it. Nothing here is generated by II itself.",
  "notes": [
    "The answers are stable public facts; they are NOT produced by this project.",
    "expected_source_domains lists domains that may support the answer. At least min_matching_domains of them must appear in the result.",
